You may add your own copyright and attribution notices for your original modifications, but you may not remove, obscure, falsely attribute, or materially alter the notices required by this section.

Individual contributors may not impose additional mandatory attribution notices on downstream recipients merely by contributing to the project unless those additional requirements are expressly incorporated into the project-level `NOTICE` file by the project maintainers.

